<div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#767469;margin-top:3px\">5</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#767469;margin-top:6px\">획 데이터: Make Me a Hanzi (Arphic Public License)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;border-top:3px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#F5F3EE\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:4px\">오늘의 한 문장</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:14px\">오늘 배운 글자가 진짜 기사 제목에 이렇게 나왔습니다</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.6;color:#0D1725;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;word-break:keep-all;margin-bottom:8px\">注<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">意</span>监测<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">身</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">体</span>状况</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">zhùyì jiāncè shēntǐ zhuàngkuàng</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">몸 상태를 잘 살피시기 바랍니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">오늘 배운 身体가 &#x27;状况(상태)&#x27; 앞에 붙어 &#x27;몸 상태&#x27; 라는 한 덩어리를 만들었습니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">身体</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">shēntǐ</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">몸, 건강 상태</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">状况</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">zhuàngkuàng</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">상황, 상태</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">注意</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">zhùyì</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">주의하다, 신경 쓰다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">监测</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">jiāncè</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">관찰하며 살피다</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div>\n<p><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day44-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day44-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE52UHpHQVFJZTQ3cnVNaE5BZDBScEJOaTlaNy1UbzktUk0xVDRjZTdTNjJrWkNPaWltcmY0NHFpV3AxUzd4Tm1FeUlUd1pkZnAzeGY0OElKT1RRak5NTE42R1dBVlc5NFkyZ2NnanJUX3I2SkhyYVE?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">潮新闻客户端</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">身体</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">shēntǐ</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">몸, 건강 상태 (명사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">不舒服</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">bù shūfu</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">몸이 안 좋다, 불편하다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">头疼</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">tóu téng</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">머리가 아프다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">医院</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">yīyuàn</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">병원 (명사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">吃药</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">chī yào</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">약을 먹다</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E1D8;margin:30px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">지난 수업</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/?p=2567\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#8C6423;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all\">← 今天天气怎么样·冷·晴天 날씨 묻고 답하기 (중국어 43일차)</a></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-top:8px\">하루 한 편씩 쌓는 중입니다. 오늘이 44일차입니다. <a href=\"https://daytip.kr/chinese-course/\" style=\"color:#8C6423\">전체 목차 →</a></div>\n</div>\n",
